msgstr "6. 保存为 MPFB 表情以保留。"

#: __init__.py:996
msgid "Add to MPFB Library"
msgstr "添加到 MPFB 库"

#: __init__.py:1047
msgid "Among candidate surfaces facing the target vertex, prefer the one whose normal agrees with the vertex's own normal. Keeps a closed mouth's inner and outer sheets (and other coincident double surfaces) from binding to each other across the gap, without the over-culling of a global opposed-normal rejection"
msgstr "在朝向目标顶点的候选表面中，优先选择法线与顶点自身法线一致的表面。可避免闭合嘴巴的内外层（以及其他重合的双层表面）跨间隙相互绑定，同时不会像全局反向法线剔除那样过度剔除"

#: __init__.py:1102
msgid "Anchors influence only within the Influence Radius (compact Wendland falloff to zero): lip markers move the lips and a small halo of skin, and never pull distant vertices. Beyond the radius the mesh keeps its neutral shape"
msgstr "锚点仅在影响半径内产生作用（紧凑的 Wendland 衰减至零）：唇部标记只移动嘴唇及周围一小圈皮肤，绝不会拉扯远处顶点。超出半径的网格保持中性形状"

#: __init__.py:990
msgid "Author"
msgstr "作者"

#: __init__.py:990
msgid "Author stored in the expression file"
msgstr "存储在表情文件中的作者"

#: __init__.py:1034
msgid "Bind Visible Surfaces Only"
msgstr "仅绑定可见表面"

#: __init__.py:1034
msgid "Bind each target vertex to the nearest source surface that faces it (front-facing = visible from that point); if the closest triangle is a backface, the next-nearest front-facing one is used instead. Inner mouth bags, nostril bags and eyelid folds then bind to their own visible sheet instead of gluing to a facing surface across the gap"
msgstr "将每个目标顶点绑定到朝向它的最近源表面（正面 = 从该点可见）；如果最近的三角形是背面，则改用次近的正面三角形。这样口腔内袋、鼻孔内袋和眼睑褶皱会绑定到自身可见的表面，而不会跨间隙粘到对面的表面上"

#: __init__.py:2337
msgid "Build the transfer map first while Source is neutral."
msgstr "请先在源为中性姿态时构建传递映射。"

#: __init__.py:1517
msgid "Bundled mappings cannot be replaced. Load it and save a new one instead."
msgstr "内置映射无法替换。请加载它，然后另存为新映射。"

#: __init__.py:1646
msgid "Bundled mappings ship with the add-on and cannot be deleted."
msgstr "内置映射随插件提供，无法删除。"

#: __init__.py:1539
msgid "Choose Source and Target meshes before loading."
msgstr "加载前请先选择源网格和目标网格。"

#: __init__.py:1447
msgid "Choose Source and Target meshes before saving."
msgstr "保存前请先选择源网格和目标网格。"

#: __init__.py:2019
#: __init__.py:2512
msgid "Choose Source and Target meshes."
msgstr "请选择源网格和目标网格。"

#: __init__.py:2825
msgid "Choose a Target mesh."
msgstr "请选择目标网格。"

#: __init__.py:1261
#: __init__.py:1402
msgid "Choose both Source and Target meshes."
msgstr "请同时选择源网格和目标网格。"

#: __init__.py:1426
msgid "Cleared all correspondences."
msgstr "已清除所有对应关系。"

#: __init__.py:1179
msgid "Click correspondence markers to delete their pairs"
msgstr "点击对应标记以删除其配对"

#: __init__.py:984
msgid "Comma-separated tags stored in the expression file"
msgstr "存储在表情文件中的逗号分隔标签"

#: __init__.py:1072
msgid "Comma-separated vertex group names to exclude from the transfer map (left unmapped / frozen at Basis). Prefilled with MPFB basemesh helper groups (tongue, teeth, eyes, eyelashes, joint cubes, hair helpers); unknown names are ignored, so edit the list for other meshes or clear it"
msgstr "以逗号分隔的顶点组名称，将从传递映射中排除（保持未映射/冻结在 Basis）。已预填 MPFB 基础网格的辅助组（舌头、牙齿、眼睛、睫毛、关节方块、毛发辅助）；未知名称会被忽略，因此可针对其他网格编辑此列表或将其清空"

#: __init__.py:1091
msgid "Comma-separated vertex group names to influence: when set, only vertices in these groups are mapped and everything else stays at Basis. Empty = all vertices (minus Excluded Groups). Unknown names are ignored"
msgstr "以逗号分隔的要影响的顶点组名称：设置后仅映射这些组中的顶点，其余顶点保持在 Basis。留空 = 所有顶点（减去排除的顶点组）。未知名称会被忽略"

#: __init__.py:1251
msgid "Delete correspondence pairs instead of creating them"
msgstr "删除对应配对而不是创建配对"

#: __init__.py:1386
msgid "Deleted last correspondence."
msgstr "已删除最后一个对应关系。"

#: __init__.py:1113
msgid "Distance over which an anchor's influence falls to zero. ~4cm covers lips plus a natural skin halo around them. Add more markers to widen coverage instead of raising this"
msgstr "锚点影响衰减至零的距离。约 4cm 可覆盖嘴唇及其周围自然的皮肤光晕。要扩大覆盖范围请添加更多标记，而不是提高此值"

#: __init__.py:1072
msgid "Excluded Vertex Groups"
msgstr "排除的顶点组"

#: __init__.py:978
msgid "Expression File"
msgstr "表情文件"

#: __init__.py:1126
msgid "Expression Scale"
msgstr "表情缩放"

#: __init__.py:2969
#: __init__.py:3057
msgid "Expression Transfer"
msgstr "表情传递"

#: __init__.py:3090
msgid "File Details"
msgstr "文件详情"

#: __init__.py:978
msgid "Filename for the saved MPFB expression. Blank uses the shape key name."
msgstr "保存的 MPFB 表情的文件名。留空则使用形态键名称。"

#: __init__.py:1134
msgid "Fill motion for unmapped vertices from their mapped neighbours (mesh-Laplacian smoothing, fading out over a dozen edge rings). Removes frozen/moved seam artefacts at the edge of the mapped region; distant geometry stays neutral and excluded vertex groups stay frozen"
msgstr "用已映射的相邻顶点为未映射顶点填充运动（网格拉普拉斯平滑，在十几个边环范围内逐渐衰减）。可消除映射区域边缘冻结/移动的接缝伪影；远处几何体保持中性，排除的顶点组保持冻结"

#: __init__.py:3028
msgid "Fit"
msgstr "拟合"

#: __init__.py:1159
msgid "Fit Smoothness"
msgstr "拟合平滑度"

#: __init__.py:1023
msgid "Freeze target vertices inside the mouth cavity (their normals face into the cavity, unlike the outer lip skin). Heuristic: can freeze real lip skin near the rim; prefer Excluded Vertex Groups and Bind Visible Surfaces Only when possible"
msgstr "冻结口腔内部的目标顶点（其法线朝向腔内，与外唇皮肤不同）。启发式方法：可能冻结靠近边缘的真实唇部皮肤；如有可能，请优先使用排除的顶点组和仅绑定可见表面"

#: __init__.py:940
msgid "How Source and Target correspondence is established"
msgstr "源与目标对应关系的建立方式"

#: __init__.py:1002
msgid "Ignore target vertices farther than this from the fitted source surface. 0 means unlimited."
msgstr "忽略距拟合后的源表面超过此距离的目标顶点。0 表示不限。"

#: __init__.py:1091
msgid "Included Vertex Groups"
msgstr "包含的顶点组"

#: __init__.py:1113
msgid "Influence Radius"
msgstr "影响半径"

#: __init__.py:1010
msgid "Leave target vertices unmapped when the surface they bind to faces away from their own sheet (opposed normals). This is what kept an MPFB target's upper inner lip stuck to the lower inner lip: the two sheets touch across the mouth gap and plain nearest-surface projection flips between them. Only same-facing, surface-connected projections move; disable to restore plain nearest-surface behaviour"
msgstr "当目标顶点绑定到的表面背对其自身表面（法线相反）时，让其保持未映射。这正是 MPFB 目标的上内唇粘住下内唇的原因：两层表面在口腔间隙处相接触，而普通的最近表面投影会在两者之间来回切换。只有朝向一致且表面相连的投影才会移动；禁用可恢复普通的最近表面行为"

#: __init__.py:1102
msgid "Local Anchor Influence"
msgstr "局部锚点影响"

#: __init__.py:3102
msgid "MPFB expressions not available"
msgstr "MPFB 表情不可用"

#: __init__.py:3094
msgid "MPFB found: set Target to an MPFB basemesh"
msgstr "已找到 MPFB：请将目标设为 MPFB 基础网格"

#: __init__.py:2662
msgid "MPFB is not installed."
msgstr "未安装 MPFB。"

#: __init__.py:944
msgid "Manual Correspondences"
msgstr "手动对应关系"

#: __init__.py:2063
msgid "Manual Correspondences mode needs at least 4 pairs. Facial transfers usually benefit from 12-30+."
msgstr "手动对应关系模式至少需要 4 对。面部传递通常建议 12-30 对以上。"

