#: __init__.py:1159
msgid "Small regularization value for the landmark warp. Increase slightly only if fitting is unstable."
msgstr "特征点变形的正则化值，保持较小。仅在拟合不稳定时略微增大。"

#: __init__.py:1134
msgid "Smooth Unmapped Fill"
msgstr "平滑未映射填充"

#: __init__.py:1146
msgid "Smooth the transferred motion across mapped vertices (anchors and excluded groups pinned). Nearest-triangle binding is per-vertex, so adjacent target verts can bind to opposite sides of a sharp static/moving seam on the source (inner mouth bag beside the moving outer lip), producing spikes. This relaxes those binding discontinuities without softening the expression"
msgstr "在已映射顶点之间平滑所传递的运动（锚点和排除组固定）。最近三角形绑定是逐顶点的，因此相邻目标顶点可能绑定到源上静止/运动突变接缝的两侧（如运动外唇旁的口腔内袋），产生尖刺。此选项可松弛这些绑定不连续，而不会软化表情"

#: __init__.py:959
msgid "Source Mesh"
msgstr "源网格"

#: __init__.py:3046
msgid "Source and Target must already overlap."
msgstr "源与目标必须已经重叠。"

#: __init__.py:2581
