msgstr "源没有可传递的非 Basis 形态键。"

#: __init__.py:2043
msgid "Source mesh has no usable polygon surface."
msgstr "源网格没有可用的多边形表面。"

#: __init__.py:2351
msgid "Source topology changed after mapping."
msgstr "映射后源拓扑已改变。"

#: __init__.py:984
msgid "Tags"
msgstr "标签"

#: __init__.py:966
msgid "Target Mesh"
msgstr "目标网格"

#: __init__.py:2743
msgid "Target has no non-Basis shape keys to export."
msgstr "目标没有可导出的非 Basis 形态键。"

#: __init__.py:2671
msgid "Target has no shape keys. Transfer first."
msgstr "目标没有形态键。请先传递。"

#: __init__.py:2667
msgid "Target must be an MPFB basemesh."
msgstr "目标必须是 MPFB 基础网格。"

#: __init__.py:2344
msgid "The runtime transfer map belongs to different Source/Target objects."
msgstr "运行时传递映射属于不同的源/目标物体。"

#: __init__.py:1451
msgid "There are no correspondence pairs to save."
msgstr "没有可保存的对应点对。"

#: __init__.py:1560
msgid "This is not a recognized mapping file."
msgstr "这不是可识别的映射文件。"

#: __init__.py:2355
msgid "This runtime map was not built with Manual Correspondences. Rebuild the map."
msgstr "此运行时映射并非使用手动对应关系构建。请重建映射。"

#: __init__.py:944
msgid "Use manually paired Source/Target vertices and an RBF fit. Meshes may be anywhere."
msgstr "使用手动配对的源/目标顶点和 RBF 拟合。网格可位于任意位置。"

#: __init__.py:949
msgid "Use nearest-surface correspondence directly. Source and Target must already overlap spatially."
msgstr "直接使用最近表面对应关系。源与目标必须在空间上已经重叠。"

#: __init__.py:1059
msgid "When the Source names an inner-mouth bag (GNM head's 'mouth_sock') and the Target is an MPFB basemesh, bind the target's cavity-facing vertices to that bag and its outer vertices to the skin. Keeps the outer lip from gluing to the inner bag and vice versa, which otherwise folds the mouth corners. Ignored when the Source has no inner-mouth group"
msgstr "当源命名了口腔内袋（GNM 头部的 'mouth_sock'）且目标是 MPFB 基础网格时，将目标朝向口腔的顶点绑定到该内袋，将其外部顶点绑定到皮肤。可避免外唇与内袋相互粘连，否则会使嘴角折叠。源没有口腔内组时忽略"

