#: __init__.py:2724
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Project every non-Basis Target shape key onto MPFB's ARKit face units and write one MPFB expression per key. Requires MPFB and an MPFB basemesh as Target."
msgstr "将所有非 Basis 的目标形态键投影到 MPFB 的 ARKit 面部单元上，并为每个键写入一个 MPFB 表情。需要 MPFB，且目标须为 MPFB 基础网格。"

#: __init__.py:2680
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Project the Target shape key onto MPFB's ARKit face units and write it as an MPFB expression. Requires MPFB and an MPFB basemesh as Target."
msgstr "将目标形态键投影到 MPFB 的 ARKit 面部单元上，并写为 MPFB 表情。需要 MPFB，且目标须为 MPFB 基础网格。"

