msgid "Return the Target to its rest face without collapsing it: zero MPFB '!ex-' face units and this addon's transferred expressions, while keeping identity/modeling morphs and the Basis. The MPFB equivalent of resetting the GNM head"
msgstr "将目标恢复到静止面部而不使其塌陷：将 MPFB 的“!ex-”面部单元和本插件传递的表情归零，同时保留身份/建模形态与 Basis。相当于对 GNM 头部执行重置的 MPFB 版本。"

